    "text": "The relation between equilibrium constant (K) and <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup></math> is given as<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.059</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br />here, n = 2<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0.54</mn><mtext>V</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.059</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1.08</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.059</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>18.3</mn></math><br />On taking antilog<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.01</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
